      <user-id><![CDATA[N54661692]]></user-id>
      <user-title><![CDATA[By requiring a vendor-signed cryptographic signature for any firmware update, we ensure the hardware will reject any 3rd-party or 'malicious' binary before it is ever executed.]]></user-title>
