      <type>2</type>
      <user-id><![CDATA[N66682480]]></user-id>
      <user-title><![CDATA[By verifying that the UART/I2C interface is configured primarily for 'Output-Only' (telemetry) and that 'Input' (command) depth is strictly limited, we prevent the module from being used as a bidirectional proxy for 3rd-party commands.]]></user-title>
