]]></html-annotation>
    </node>
    <node reference="N82197064">
      <layout x="41412" y="50401" height="3960" width="3960" />
      <type>2</type>
      <user-id><![CDATA[N82197064]]></user-id>
      <user-title><![CDATA[By ensuring the module's operating parameters are hardcoded or stored in Read-Only memory, we mitigate the risk of a 'living-off-the-land' attack where an adversary reconfigures the module to enable hidden debug features.]]></user-title>
      <status-fields>
        <status-field type="string" name="annotation"><![CDATA[]]></status-field>
